  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "light_house_east_01",
      "hash64": "949680CF782EEFBA",
      "text": "燈塔上面真是安靜。\\n叫做電海燕的寶可夢\\r\\n有時候也會來這裡休息喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "light_house_east_02",
      "hash64": "94967FCF782EEE07",
      "text": "我在通往這裡的坡道上看到了洛托姆！\\n是沒有進到手機裡去的單純的洛托姆喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "light_house_east_03",
      "hash64": "94967ECF782EEC54",
      "text": "最先進的城鎮竟然\\n後方就和大自然相連著！\\r\\n真是讓我這個登山女孩的心雀躍不已啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "light_house_west_01",
      "hash64": "E34070F63FE676BC",
      "text": "從上面看過去的話，\\n市場也會變得那麼小啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "light_house_west_03",
      "hash64": "E34072F63FE67A22",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也是穿過了\\n烘烘沙漠來的嗎？\\r\\n有沒有看到奇怪的寶可夢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "light_house_west_04",
      "hash64": "E3406DF63FE671A3",
      "text": "要回玻瓶市的話，\\n果然還是搭飛翔計程車好了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "light_house_west_08",
      "hash64": "E34079F63FE68607",
      "text": "我在拍賣會上花了一大筆錢……\\n海風讓我的眼睛有點酸酸的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "light_house_north_05",
      "hash64": "8C8B5391EE4487E6",
      "text": "小小的狗仔軟綿綿的！\\n嗯～！那就是狗仔包！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
